sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant React
    participant FastAPI
    participant MongoDB
    Student->>React: Enter email and password
    React->>FastAPI: POST /api/auth/login
    FastAPI->>MongoDB: Find student by email
    MongoDB-->>FastAPI: Student record
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Verify password hash
    FastAPI-->>React: JWT and student profile
    React-->>Student: Display dashboard
